  "tagline": "3 bedrooms, sleeps 7",
  "summary": "Experience the authentic charm of Eugene in this spacious 3-bedroom historic home. Famed for its signature Sunshine Yellow retro kitchen and vintage quirks, this house invites you to slow down and enjoy the moment.\n\nOnly a short walk to Hayward Field and UO, it is the perfect gathering place for families attending graduations, games, or reunions who want room to spread out.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The space",
      "text": "Hardwood floors, original architectural details, and a distinct sense of place you will not find in a cookie-cutter rental. Three comfortable bedrooms and spacious living areas ensure everyone has their own corner. A fully equipped, retro-styled kitchen that brings a smile to your face. Bonus space in the basement for luggage storage or a quiet escape."
    },
    {
      "title": "Guest access",
      "text": "This place shares a yard with another one of our Airbnb rentals. The yard is divided by a fence and our other rental allows dogs.\n\nThere is a basement bedroom, it's a bit rugged, but great for kids and/or privacy away from the upstairs guests.\n\n* occasionally, our cleaners will need to use the basement laundry. Be aware between 11am - 3pm, we may briefly walk through the shared basement area to access the laundry."
    },
    {
      "title": "Other things to note",
      "text": "* Parking space is suitable for two small cars back to back or one truck. Not appropriate for 2 large vehicles :(\n\nNeed more Space? See about renting both house and studio: listed under our other properties :)"
    }
  ],
